{
	"name": "CombatHud",
	"_doc": "The combat HUD (Config/Hud; src/client/HudKit builds it, src/client/AmmoHud, StaffHud and ArtilleryHud fill it). No panels or backgrounds (user 2026-10-26): each cut-away (`model`, a ViewportFrame) floats over the game, the gun's at the bottom right, the staff's rock in the same place, the artillery crew's at the bottom centre; one shows at a time. Sizes in reference pixels at theme.scale.referenceHeight, one UIScale. Colours are Config/Palette UI.Hud names. The gun's cut-away is two layers (user 2026-10-26: \"make everything else just a simple shadow sillouette\"): GunShadow, the gun's body as one flat see-through shadow, under GunView, the clear bolt, rounds and magazine well (a child draws over its parent). Desktop only.",
